  "sourceRefs": [
    {
      "id": "en:summary",
      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "summary",
      "text": "Whenever an enemy champion dies that Katarina has damaged recently, her remaining ability cooldowns are dramatically reduced. If Katarina picks up a Dagger, she uses it to slash through all nearby enemies, dealing magic damage.",
      "variant": null
    },
    {
      "id": "en:body",
      "locale": "en_US",
      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Whenever an enemy champion dies that Katarina has damaged in the last 3 seconds, her Ability Cooldowns are reduced by 15 seconds. If Katarina picks up a Dagger, she uses it to slash through all nearby enemies, dealing ((68 ~ 240) + (60% bonus Attack Damage) + ((70% ~ 100%) Ability Power)) magic damage.",
      "variant": null
    },
    {
      "id": "ko:summary",
      "locale": "ko_KR",
      "tier": "summary",
      "text": "카타리나가 최근에 피해를 입힌 챔피언이 죽을 때마다 카타리나에게 적용 중인 스킬 재사용 대기시간이 크게 감소합니다. 카타리나가 단검을 다시 주우면 근처의 적을 모두 공격해 마법 피해를 입힙니다.",
      "variant": null
    },
    {
